@startuml
!theme plain
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty description
[*] --> NoAccess
NoAccess --> Scheduled : grant(start, end)\n[start > now]
NoAccess --> Active : grant(start, end)\n[start <= now]
Scheduled --> Active : startTimeReached
Active : entry / enable guest key
Active : do / accept unlock requests
Active : exit / disable guest key
Active --> Active : unlockRequest / unlock door; log
Active --> Expired : endTimeReached
Scheduled --> Revoked : revoke
Active --> Revoked : revoke / log
Expired : entry / log expiry
Expired --> [*]
Revoked --> [*]
@enduml
